decision=observed
identity=12-galaxy-intelligence
intent=Execute G-01 through G-03 and I-01 through I-03 with the existing executable seed
scope=3 training batches and 6 disjoint held-out batches with unchanged Rust acceptance checks
galaxy=ga-producer.run -> ga-consumer.run -> ga-feedback.run; consumer added and retained fir
intelligence=External agent wrote the selector and fixed the corpus. The selector learned which runnable procedure to retain from measured training observations. Autonomous discovery of the learning rule was not demonstrated.
heldout_accepted=6
