observation=Reuse lowered measured recurring work on several held-out batches. Total cost including setup was higher than both comparators at this sample size. Wall time is one local run with subprocess and disk overhead.
continuation=No additional learning machinery is justified by these results. Apply the gated loop to a real source artifact.

